{"title": "Hiding (Condition)", "pageid": 6852, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the condition. For items that grant or interact with it, see <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_set\" title=\"Hiding set\">Hiding set</a>.   </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiding Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Hiding</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is invisible to enemies until it crosses their cone of sight.</li>\n<li>The entity has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a